step_details.raw_response:
Thought: Test a simple best_single ETS strategy to see if a single strong model beats the mean baseline.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"best_single","model":"ETS"}

Thought: Test a robust median over a small, highly correlated pool (pool1) to see if reducing variance improves SMAPE.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool1"}

Thought: Test the robust best_single strategy with the most accurate model (rf) to see if single model beats the mean baseline.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"best_single","model":"rf"}

Thought: Test a robust median combination on a stable pool of 7 models to see if it beats the mean baseline.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool2"}

Thought: Test a robust trimmed‑mean over the full model pool to see if trimming improves over the plain mean baseline.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"trimmed_mean","pool":"pool_full","trim_pct":0.2}

Thought: Test a best_single strategy with the highly ranked seasonal model ONLY_FT_catboost to see if a single strong seasonal model beats the mean baseline.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"best_single","model":"ONLY_FT_catboost"}

Thought: Test a weighted average using inverse_error weights on the full model pool to see if it beats the best_single baseline.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","models":["ETS","THETA","NaiveMovingAverage","ARIMA","ONLY_FT_catboost","rf","ONLY_FT_rf","catboost"],"weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a Denoising Autoencoder (dba) on pool4 to see if a learned ensemble improves over weighted inverse-error.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool4","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test a robust trimmed‑mean over pool4 to see if trimming improves on the weighted inverse‑error result.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"trimmed_mean","pool":"pool4","trim_pct":0.2}

Thought: Test a robust median over the best pool (pool4) to see if it beats the weighted inverse‑error result.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool4"}

Thought: Test a simple mean over pool4 to see if averaging across the best pool improves on the median result.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"mean","pool":"pool4"}

Thought: Test a robust median over pool3 to see if a different pool improves on the current leader.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool3"}

